("This procedure spreads members of each family across folds while keeping total fold sizes balanced.\n\nThe fixed seed preserves exactly the same partition across executions.", "This procedure spreads members of each family across folds while keeping total fold sizes balanced. After allocation, `apply(family_fold_table, 1, max)` and `apply(family_fold_table, 1, min)` compute, for each row of the table — that is, for each family — the largest and smallest counts across folds. The argument `1` specifies a row-wise operation; the difference between maximum and minimum forms `family_balance`.\n\nThe fixed seed preserves exactly the same partition across executions."),
